//     all submitted tasks to complete or until the context is canceled.
//     Returns an error if the context is canceled before all tasks complete.
//   - Close(): Closes the pool, preventing new submissions. Does not wait for
//     pending tasks to complete.
//
// Concurrency invariants:
//   - At most `capacity` tasks execute concurrently.
//   - Results are delivered in submission order.
//   - Panics in task execution are recovered and converted to errors.
//   - No goroutine leaks: all worker goroutines exit when the pool is closed.
//   - No data races: all shared state is protected by mutexes or atomic operations.
