//! - Keys and values are owned by the cache (`K: Clone + Eq + Hash`, `V: Clone`).
//! - The clock is shared via `Arc<dyn Clock>` to allow injectable deterministic clocks.
//! - LRU order is maintained via a `VecDeque` of keys; most recently used at the back.
//! - Each entry stores its insertion time for TTL checking.
