//
//   - (*Pool).Stats() (submitted, completed, panics int)
//     Returns counters for submitted tasks, completed tasks, and recovered panics.
//
// Concurrency invariants:
//   - The queue is a buffered channel of tasks. Capacity is fixed at creation.
//   - Workers pull tasks from the queue and execute them.
