//     to the pool. Returns a channel that will receive exactly one Result when the
//     task completes, is canceled, or the pool is shut down. If the pool is full
//     (backpressure), Submit blocks until a worker is available or ctx is canceled.
//     Returns an error if the pool is closed or if capacity was invalid.
//   - Shutdown(ctx context.Context) error: Gracefully shuts down the pool.
//     Stops accepting new tasks, waits for in-flight tasks to complete (or ctx
